            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.10.34

- Added two-finger horizontal trackpad navigation while the pointer is over the overlay.
- Swipe right-to-left for the next track and left-to-right for the previous track.
- Added direction normalization, diagonal rejection, momentum filtering, and one action per physical gesture.
]]></description>
